# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Whitelist-based .gitignore
# デフォルト全除外 → OSS公開対象のみ許可
# semantic-links: [[忍者報告品質プロトコル]]
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Step 1: 全て除外
*
!requirements.txt

# Step 2: ディレクトリの探索を許可（中身は個別に許可）
!*/

# Local runtime / sandbox artifacts
# Mutable telemetry is intentionally runtime-only.  Keeping its hot JSONL in
# the index makes every correctly recorded event appear as an infrastructure
# "uncommitted change" and eventually exceeds GitHub's object-size limit.
logs/defense_overhead.jsonl
logs/archive/defense_overhead_*.jsonl
.cycle*_bench/
.worktree-*/
logs/wave-final-checkpoints/*/tree/
.codex-tmp/
.codex_tmp/
.codex/*
!.codex/hooks.json
.codd/
.obsidian/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tmp/
tmp_report_merge_*/
**/__pycache__/
android/app/build/
tmp/
.venv/
.claude/worktrees/
memory/.obsidian/
test-results/
queue/dispatch_ntfy_started/
queue/draft_review_started/
queue/gates/
queue/locks/
queue/memory_db_live_insert_queue/

# Step 3: OSS公開対象ファイルを許可
